    translit: "yoga-sthaḥ kuru karmāṇi saṅgaṃ tyaktvā dhanañjaya |\nsiddhy-asiddhyoḥ samo bhūtvā samatvaṃ yoga ucyate ||",
    source: "भगवद्गीता २.४८",
