    translit: "adveṣṭā sarva-bhūtānāṃ maitraḥ karuṇa eva ca |\nnirmamo nirahaṅkāraḥ sama-duḥkha-sukhaḥ kṣamī ||",
    source: "भगवद्गीता १२.१३",
